INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#1','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',1,'New Dragon, Ilulu! (Please Be Nice to Her Again)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259681/original.jpg','The self-proclaimed ultimate maid Tohru storms into a new maid cafe opening up soon with a sense of rivalry. However, when she returns she says, "Somehow I''ve ended up working there!" As they live out such typical days in their lives, she and Miss Kobayashi learn from the news that someone has destroyed the mountain where they met. (Source: Crunchyroll)','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":71,"end":161},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1318,"end":1408}]','2021-07-08','259681');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#2','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',2,'Hot Guy Kobayashi! (In Many Senses)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259682/original.png','Miss Kobayashi managed to drive Ilulu away, but in return, she got a you-know-what attached to her groin with magic. Because of that you-know-what, she starts perceiving behaviors that she would usually think nothing of in a different light and starts getting more and more turned on by Tohru. (Source: Crunchyroll)','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":47,"end":137},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-07-15','259682');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#3','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',3,'Extracurricular Activities (Of Course They''re Not Normal)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259683/original.jpg','Saikawa visits Miss Kobayashi''s home to play. However, there''s a girl that''s unfamiliar to her (Ilulu)... Even after inviting her to join their games, Ilulu coldly refuses. Then Lucoa happens to stop by and she notices Ilulu''s feelings as she tries to avoid them, so she makes an effort to help the dragon out. (Source: Crunchyroll)','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":66,"end":156},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-07-22','259683');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#4','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',4,'When in Rome, do as the Romans do (Quite Hard to Put Together)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259684/original.png','Takiya and Miss Kobayashi are impressed by a beautiful array of code. Surprisingly, the one who wrote it was Elma. Miss Kobayashi is overjoyed to finally have more fully capable manpower. Then Elma hears that Miss Kobayashi is considered a "pillar" of the company who handles much more work than her, which causes her to suddenly get mad. (Source: Crunchyroll)','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":25,"end":115},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-07-29','259684');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#5','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',5,'Together With You (Well, If We Get Along)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259685/original.jpg','Elma and Tohru snarl at each other every time they meet in the shopping district. Miss Kobayashi is exasperated at that typical scene, but they mention it wasn''t like that when they first met. Even though they get along like oil and water now, their first encounter took place long, long ago. It happened way back when Tohru was traveling by herself through the other world... (Source: Crunchyroll)','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":34,"end":124},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-08-05','259685');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#6','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',6,'Uncanny Relationships (One Side Is a Dragon)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259686/original.jpg','Shouta is troubled over how to approach Lucoa about her daily, uninhibited contact. He should be the master in their relationship, though... He resolves to take back control as the full-fledged mage he''s aiming to become. So he begins trying to uncover Lucoa''s weaknesses. (Source: Crunchyroll)','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":38,"end":128},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-08-12','259686');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#7','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',7,'Common Sense (It''s Different For Everyone)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259687/original.jpg','Two suspicious figures appear in a dark alley under the cover of night. An unsettling air hangs over their secret exchange. "What do you need, asking me to come here?" asks the perverted woman with two horns. "Lend me your power," answers the melancholic man in a butler uniform. And so the most sinister and awful tag team begins to take action. (Source: Crunchyroll)','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":33,"end":123},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-08-19','259687');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#8','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',8,'The World''s Only (Insert Phrase You Like Here)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259688/original.png','Shouta suddenly begins shutting himself up in his room. He''s pouring over a complicated grimoire in order to create a magic item as a gift for Father''s Day. Lucoa offers to help him since the task is so difficult, but he refuses and declares he must accomplish it by himself. However, he continues to fail to produce it... (Source: Crunchyroll)','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":31,"end":121},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-08-26','259688');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#9','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',9,'There Are Various Reasons Behind It (It''s Full of Elma)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259689/original.jpg','','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":52,"end":142},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-09-02','259689');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#10','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',10,'Kanna''s Summer Break (Broadcast In Two Languages!?)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259690/original.jpg','After having a fight with Miss Kobayashi, Kanna runs away from home. Since she doesn''t want to go home she flies across the ocean to somewhere brighter where the sun''s still out. Kanna lands on the continent she happens to find during her flight, putting her in New York, the city that never sleeps. (Source: Crunchyroll)','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":58,"end":148},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-09-09','259690');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#11','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',11,'Premium Seat (No Extra Charge)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/259691/original.jpg','','[{"kind":"intro","label":"Opening","start":26,"end":116},{"kind":"outro","label":"Ending","start":1310,"end":1400}]','2021-09-16','259691');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO episode (id,anime_id,n,title,runtime,runtime_seconds,thumb,synopsis,markers,airdate,external_id) VALUES ('miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s#12','miss-kobayashi-s-dragon-maid-s',12,'Life is Constant Change (But It''s Okay To Stop And Appreciate It)','24:00',1440,'https://media.kitsu.app/episode/259692/thumbnail/medium-dbc745286b3639f3df86f509bdc014d4.jpeg','A typical morning with typical dragon girls. A priceless slice of daily life without any complaints. However, ever since Miss Kobayashi heard the tale from the Emperor of Demise, something has been slightly weighing on her. Yet it''s not clear to her what exactly that is. As that uncertainty builds, the summer festival they''ve all been waiting for is drawing closer. (Source: Crunchyroll)','[]','2021-09-23','259692');
